    bullets: ["A thorough initial assessment of your symptoms, history, and current and past medications","A personalized plan that discusses options, expected benefits, and possible side effects","Follow-up visits to track how you are responding","Doses can be adjusted or medications changed as your needs evolve","Medication is often combined with psychotherapy, lifestyle changes, and social support","For patients who only need medication management and do not have complicated treatment plans, a 15 minute appointment is available"],
